gh agency, personal trust, IRA, and personal investment management accounts; and various retail investment products, such as the U.S. government bonds, tax-free municipal bonds, stocks, mutual funds, unit investment trusts, annuities, life insurance, and long-term health care, as well as business, estate, financial, insurance and business planning, tax planning, and asset protection advisory services. Further, the company offers mortgage banking. Capital City Bank Group, Inc. was founded in 1895 and is headquartered in Tallahassee, Florida."}}